    "name": "FDX V6.0.0 Account Information API",
    "description": "## FDX compliance\n\nThe Core Exchange API specifications are a subset of the Financial Data Exchange (FDX) API specification, the usage thereof (or any part thereof) constitutes acceptance of the FDX API\nLicense Agreement, which can be found at https://financialdataexchange.org/.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Plaid support\n Email: dataconnectivity@plaid.com",
